abstract: >-
  A unified framework proposing one invariant algorithm — DETECT, PROCESS,
  RESPOND — operating at every scale of reality, expressed across seventeen
  layers, ten Universal Process Domains, and seventy-plus operational
  algorithms (v5.1), run against itself at higher resolution (v5.2), and
  extended with a meta-tier, the Container (v5.3). Governed by the Variable
  Principle: never fill an unmeasured variable with assumption.
